server.description: "| Hybrid PvE | Rotating PvP Monuments | Player-Built Raid Bases |\n| NPC Raidable Bases | Dungeons | Heli & Bradley Signals | QoL Mods |\n\nWe are a new-player-friendly PvE server with optional PvP events.\n\nPvE is serverwide by default. No unauthorized raiding.\nBases, loot, storage, and deployables are protected by Team/TC ownership, with optional sharing for trusted players.\n\nPvP is limited to rotating PvP monuments and optional player-defended raid base events.\nWatch the zone warnings — spicy zones mean spicy consequences.\n\nServer Restarts Daily @ 6 AM EST"
